-	  does not provide a complete
-	  set of MT6873 clocks; other clock IDs intentionally remain
-	  unavailable until their hardware data is validated.
+	  PMIC wrapper, initial UFS bring-up, the SPI controllers, the USB
+	  xHCI clock chain, and the MT6360 I2C5 clock chain from APMIXED,
+	  TOPCKGEN, INFRACFG_AO and IMP_IIC_WRAP_W. It does not provide a
